  "hypothesis": "On the ARM64 target, explicitly comparing four adjacent signed-int pairs at once in the sortedness check removes the scalar loop-carried reduction from the hot verification scan while preserving its exact nonzero/zero result; scalar fallback and tail handling retain portability and all lengths.",
